    "Direct" : "Direct",
    "Your posts do best around {hour}:00 UTC — {n} engagement each, over {posts} posts." : "Je berichten presteren het beste rond {hour}:00 UTC — {n} betrokkenheid elk, boven {posts} berichten.",
